0,Godwari dialect - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Godwari_dialect,Godwari is a dialect of Marwari (Rajasthani) spoken in Godwar region of Rajasthan. [1] It is spoken between Ahor Tehsil of Jalore to Bali tehsil of Pali district.,Godwari,Indo-European
