8,"Godwari Language (GDX) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/gdx/,Godwari is an endangered indigenous language of India. It belongs to the Indo-European language family. The language is used as a first language by some people in every generation of the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Godwari,Indo-European
